  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"studio-page--stack-media\"><section class=\"studio-intro studio-section\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Software ecodesign</p>\n                            <h2>Drive your approach by measuring efficiency</h2>\n                            <p>Awareness, training, best practices: essential, but not enough.\n                                With Greenspector Studio, objectively measure the efficiency of your digital\n                                product.</p>\n                            <p>At each step, base your decisions on reliable, complete and objective measurements,\n                                as well as rigorous impact assessment.</p>\n                            <p>Add concrete KPIs (carbon impact, ecoscore, performance, data) to your\n                                management dashboards.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Greenspector-Studio-Ecoscore-r3tmosfu8yqrw3ak5b8noo6ypd23wbpp1qnna0qh14_fdbe25f9.png\" alt=\"Greenspector Studio - Ecoscore\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Project KPIs</p>\n                            <h2>New KPIs for your project: environmental impacts and ecoscore</h2>\n                            <p><strong>Deceptively simple, the Greenspector ecoscore is based on a complete analysis</strong>\n                                of all user journey steps on three different axes, taking into account whether\n                                measured steps are critical or not. <strong>The Greenspector ecoscore truly represents your journey's efficiency level</strong>.</p>\n                            <p>With Greenspector Studio, obtain a rigorous, precise assessment of <strong>carbon impact and other environmental indicators.</strong> <a href=\"/en/studio/environmental-impact-measurement/\">Learn more about impacts (methodology, indicators…)</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Concrete results</p>\n                        <h2>From commitment of means to certainty of results</h2>\n                        <p>Your team is aware of responsible digital practices, trained in ecodesign and applying best practices. Well done!</p>\n                        <p>But beyond the means committed, what about the results? What is the real quality of the product coming out of the digital factory?</p>\n                        <p>With Greenspector Studio, ensure your application meets your expectations.</p>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Interface_Energie-par-etape-r63byp63s0kjum3ot2ueiqc9paw1fjflobxqd6n4jc_7e2fbfe9.png\" alt=\"Battery discharge rate per journey step, and categorisation for the Energy score\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Collaboration</p>\n                        <h2>Work as a team</h2>\n                        <p>Each role has its reading level and its indicators.</p>\n                        <p>Through rights management, <strong>share your Analyses with colleagues</strong> and bring the whole team into a results-driven approach.</p>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Interface_Droits-r65ddx7ma6xzz6o88mkf4q1me6s0qeuhr2m7evibaw_4581fef3.png\" alt=\"Choose visibility levels and define access for your colleagues\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Continuous improvement</p>\n                            <h2>Improve continuously!</h2>\n                            <p><strong>Run a measurement before each release to avoid anomalies and track indicator trends.</strong></p>\n                            <p>Use APIs to trigger tests from your CI/CD (GitLab CI, Azure CI, Jenkins…). Use other APIs to export results to your own dashboards.</p>\n                            <p><a href=\"/en/studio/devgreenops/\">Learn more about continuous integration</a></p>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                                <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/evolution-r41o1fvo92cqjsiy7yt7o2e2r6pln13h7djzozv2d4_4627dddb.png\" alt=\"Track ecoscore changes across versions\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <p class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-gs-primary\" href=\"/en/contact/\">Request a free demo</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-quote-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">What they say</p>\n                        <blockquote class=\"studio-quote\">\n                            <p>It was important for us to quantify and objectify the concrete impact of the ecodesign efforts we were going to deploy. Thanks to the Greenspector ecoscore, we were able to rationally assess the results of our efforts before and after the project.</p>\n                            <p>Greenspector provides a measurement tool to assess the progressive evolution of best practices implemented and identify adjustments needed for greater efficiency.</p>\n                            <footer>\n                                <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/CSmeyers-150x150_1e5f8ccb.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait of Caroline SMEYERS\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong>Caroline SMEYERS</strong>\n                                    <span>Web Manager, Bruxelles Environnement / Leefmilieu Brussels</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </footer>\n                        </blockquote>\n</section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standards</p>\n                        <h2>Compatible with leading standards</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid studio-mini-grid\">\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Recognition</h3>\n                                <p>Solution recognised for its contribution to protecting the environment.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>R&amp;D</h3>\n                                <p>Innovations from research presented at international\n                                    conferences.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Standards compatibility</h3>\n                                <p>LCA (ISO 14040), Green Software Foundation SCI, ADEME RCP and related standards.</p>\n                            </article>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">References</p>\n                        <h2>They use Greenspector Studio to combine user satisfaction, application performance and environmental responsibility</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-logo-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                        <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_sncfconnect_04f4832d.jpg\" alt=\"SNCF Connect logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                        <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_cats_8cc5042d.jpg\" alt=\"CATS logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                        <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo_AirFrance_616731c4.webp\" alt=\"Air France logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                        <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/logo-bouygues-telecom_889990d1.svg\" alt=\"Bouygues Telecom logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                        <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_orange_338b842b.jpg\" alt=\"Orange logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                        <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo-France-televisions-300x157_e988d666.jpg\" alt=\"France Télévisions logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                        <img src=\"/assets/img/external/greenspector.com/logo_Decathlon_150_b97b60d5.png\" alt=\"Decathlon logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                        <img src=\"/assets/img/external/swiftask-prod-files.s3.eu-west-3.amazonaws.com/slide1_shape10_442219a7.png\" alt=\"French Ministry of Health logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                    </figure>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"studio-section certifications\" aria-labelledby=\"certifications-title\">\n                        <h2 id=\"certifications-title\">Our certifications</h2>\n                        <div class=\"home-certifications__layout\">\n                            <figure class=\"home-certifications__medal\">\n                            <img src=\"/assets/img/medaille-or-ecovadis-sept-2026.png\" alt=\"EcoVadis Gold medal, top 5%, September 2026\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                        </figure>\n                        <p class=\"home-certifications__lead\">EcoVadis Gold certification, score of 84/100&nbsp;: Greenspector ranks among the top 5% of companies under the global EcoVadis framework.</p>\n                        <ul class=\"home-certifications__scores\">\n                            <li><span class=\"home-certifications__score\">84<span class=\"home-certifications__max\">/100</span></span><span>Environment</span></li>\n                            <li><span class=\"home-certifications__score\">84<span class=\"home-certifications__max\">/100</span></span><span>Social and Human Rights</span></li>\n                            <li><span class=\"home-certifications__score\">86<span class=\"home-certifications__max\">/100</span></span><span>Ethics</span></li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-gs-primary\" href=\"/assets/docs/fiche-evaluation-ecovadis-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discover our assessment</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </section></div>"
}
